stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading: mount
    Loading --> All: current success
    Loading --> Selected: success retaining stage
    Loading --> All: success missing stage resets with feedback
    Loading --> Refused: malformed or rejected read
    Loading --> Loading: refresh or stale completion
    All --> Selected: select stage
    Selected --> Selected: select term or stage
    Selected --> EmptySubset: AND has no matches
    EmptySubset --> Selected: change selection to matches
    Selected --> All: clear stage
    All --> Loading: compare or refresh
    Selected --> Loading: compare or refresh
    EmptySubset --> Loading: compare or refresh
    Refused --> Loading: explicit retry
    Selected --> Selected: stale completion
    Refused --> Refused: stale completion
    All --> Retired: auth retirement disposes parent
    Selected --> Retired: auth retirement disposes parent
    Loading --> Retired: auth retirement disposes parent
    All --> Disposed: dispose
    Selected --> Disposed: dispose
    EmptySubset --> Disposed: dispose
    Refused --> Disposed: dispose
    Loading --> Disposed: dispose
    Retired --> Retired: late completion ignored
    Disposed --> Disposed: late completion ignored
